# Tilted cutting plane — diagonal cut through the unit cube.
#
# Plane equation: z = 0.6*x  (normal approximately (-0.6, 0, 1) / |...|)
# Passes through the cube interior from bottom-left to top-right.
# Normal has no special alignment with any axis, so tests the generic rotation path.

v -3 -3 -1.8
v  3 -3  1.8
v  3  3  1.8
v -3  3 -1.8

f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
